      "side": 1,
      "message": "Changes in our codebase LGTM.\n\nThat said - RequiresDevice seems misnamed. Cuttlefish is a device, it\u0027s just not a physical device. Is this actually the annotation that we use to say \"doesn\u0027t run on cuttlefish\"? If so, this may be the best we can do.\n\nSome of these tests (openConnection, DNS) aren\u0027t impossible to run on a virtual device, it\u0027s just that cuttlefish networking is too limited for them to work. Again, maybe this is the best we can do?",
      "revId": "9a689f81f44f9abe5a36f5fef80dec75d17e35d0",
